{"title":"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3ed8e5b3259d942f5e4d5802eaafed6779dc24e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   0.06  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   0.6  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   6  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   60 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   600  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is the same as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b70efea4cc4bc0ecea4e4e5c7b422738ee1998.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/c/63cd46443fc2a750f004588e377134ca273d08e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 30 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"141\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4 (page d